{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/fb30ed8a9119f8ff9c16ac38cbd8b4fd.avif?t=1751715054\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>In Doctor Dreams, you enter dreams, sell illegal arsenal, manufacture medicines, talk to strangers, manage employees, and face the law. It all starts at Thornfield, a clinic inherited from your father that you can run to become the greatest magnate of Thornfield.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2bb2e0e59aeedb5a79ac2aa5f9d6ebaf.poster.avif?t=1751715054\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/2bb2e0e59aeedb5a79ac2aa5f9d6ebaf.webm?t=1751715054\" type=\"video/webm\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/DreamsVideoGif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751715054\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>40 unique minigames</strong><br>Each patient has their own nightmare. From impossible platforming to bizarre puzzles or a frantic shooter. Every dream, a new challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/CraftVideoGif2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751715054\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Medicine crafting system</strong><br>After each dream session, listen to how the patient feels and create the <strong>perfect medicine</strong>\u2026 or completely ruin it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/JudiceVideoGif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751715054\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decisions and consequences</strong><br>Gave the wrong medicine <strong>5 times</strong>? You go to trial. Lose <strong>$4500</strong>. And lose <strong>respect</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/CleanVideoGif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751715054\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage your clinic</strong><br>Receive patients, <strong>clean rooms</strong>, <strong>hire staff</strong>, <strong>upgrade facilities</strong>, and gain <strong>reputation</strong>\u2026 or go bankrupt due to malpractice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775270/extras/CraftVideoGif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1751715054\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not satisfied curing by day?</strong><br><br>Decide to <strong>sell your potions illegally at night on the black market</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But beware: <strong>the police are watching</strong>. If caught, you could lose everything\u2026 and regret it later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared